dations noted, such as the adjustment of medication and continued monitoring. It anchors its statements on evidence documented in the notes, such as the elevation in blood pressure and its management. Response B, while mentioning some symptoms and issues, does not effectively accompany them with evidence-based recommendations noted in the SOAP. [RESULT] A\n\nOverall, Response A is the better response.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1733967435, "model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_9d50cd990b", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 395, "prompt_tokens": 5945, "total_tokens": 6340, "completion_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}}


